    {
      "tipo": "explicacion",
      "titulo": {"en": "Your turn: write and speak"},
      "texto": {
        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (60–80 words).** Write a dialogue at a station or airport: buying a ticket, asking about times and platforms.\n\n**Speak (about 1 minute).** Play the traveller aloud: buy a return ticket, ask when it leaves and whether it is direct."
      }
